# --- spatial metric sampler (Grid mode; ignored when Exact = yes) ---
# local27: 27-point Lagrange fit on the 3x3x3 stencil (default)
# aei:     AEILocalInterp pointwise order-4 tensor-product Lagrange
# carpet:  CarpetInterp (DriverInterpolate, order 2; single process only,
#          the driver performs collective MPI)
